    ('lego-group-reports-record-revenue-and-profit-in-first-half-o', '19b25eee5c64ec6ef20baca08e544a3e', $b455$Your wallet might be feeling the pinch, but the LEGO Group is doing just fine. They’ve just dropped their financial results for the first half of 2026, and it’s a story of booming business. Revenue is up a massive 21% to a record DKK 41.9 billion. Even when you adjust for currency fluctuations, that’s a 26% jump.

