    ('lego-doctor-doom-bust-76345-is-this-13800-display-piece-wort', '231a07b2d465e98275a589d7867af581', $b455$Your wallet called. It wants to discuss the LEGO Doctor Doom Bust ([76345](/sets/76345-doctor-doom-bust)). Yes, the one that looks less like a Marvel villain and more like a very expensive, very grey paperweight. LEGO announced this thing and while it’s certainly a bust, the question is whether it’s a bust that belongs on your shelf or in the bin of forgotten LEGO impulse buys.

