With a theme as broad and accessible as "little guys," the challenge has drawn a huge crowd from all over the AFOL (Adult Fan of LEGO) world. The premise is simple: build a small character, something with personality, and share it on Instagram with the hashtag. Forget massive UCS sets; this is about creativity with even a handful of bricks.

