Construction‑wise the build is a carbon copy of the [43014](/sets/43014-scuderia-ferrari-hp-charles-leclerc-helmet) Charles Leclerc Helmet, with the only real differences being a silver “L” on the left side and a bold “1” on the top, signalling Norris’s world‑champion status. The base sports a tiny “Never stop building” nod that cheekily diverges from the actual helmet text. Almost every part is printed, so you’ll see the orange and vibrant yellow pop without needing extra bricks.

