    ('the-lego-volvo-ec500-hybrid-excavator-42215-big-machine-big-', '8abd82a376a33835553d37af7ffb9726', $b455$The Volvo EC500 Hybrid Excavator 42215 has landed — and your wallet already knows what is coming. Now, before we even get to the bricks, let's address the elephant in the room, or rather, the excavator in the box: the price. This is a substantial set, and your wallet is going to feel it. We're talking serious investment here, so if you're looking for a budget build, this ain't it.

